this folder contains a few codes to work with the description of the aberrations and their effect. 

- GS_2026 is a code to play with the Gerbert- Saxton algorithm. It uses as target examples two files
that are jpg images, pasttern1 and pasttern2.jpg. In colab they must be uploaded in the colabe working space
online. 

- ShackHartman is about the simulation of the output of a Chack-Hartman. 


